    <section class="flow" id="feature-flow" aria-label="A3 feature cards"><header class="flow__intro"><p class="eyebrow">A3 FEATURES</p>
<h2>Power for the<br><em>moments that matter.</em>
</h2>
<p>From a dead battery to a dark roadside, A3 keeps the essentials close. See how it fits, what it powers and what comes in the case.</p>
<span class="flow__spec">2500A peak · 800A starting · 50+ starts* · compatible 12V systems</span></header><section class="flow__stack"><article class="flag left"><div class="flag__surface">
<figure class="flag__media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-sales-feature-01.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A3 jump starter connected in a vehicle engine bay" loading="lazy" width="1464" height="600" decoding="async"></figure><div class="flag__copy">
<div class="flag__index">01 / STARTING SUPPORT</div>
<h3>Start when the battery says no.</h3>
<p>2500A peak / 800A starting current for compatible 12V vehicles. 50+ starts per charge under stated conditions.* Check the 8.0L Gas / 5.5L Diesel reference before connecting.</p>
<div class="flag__tag">vehicle fit</div>
</div>
</div></article><article class="flag right"><div class="flag__surface">
<figure class="flag__media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-sales-feature-02.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A3 jump starter shown between icy and hot conditions" loading="lazy" width="1464" height="600" decoding="async"></figure><div class="flag__copy">
<div class="flag__index">02 / ALL-SEASON READINESS</div>
<h3>Ready when conditions change.</h3>
<p>−20°C to 60°C discharge range. Battery condition, vehicle fit and connection setup still affect results.</p>
<div class="flag__tag">temperature range</div>
</div>
</div></article><article class="flag left"><div class="flag__surface">
<figure class="flag__media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-sales-feature-04.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A3 USB-C PD60W power delivery on the roadside" loading="lazy" width="1464" height="600" decoding="async"></figure><div class="flag__copy">
<div class="flag__index">03 / POWER DELIVERY</div>
<h3>Keep your gear moving.</h3>
<p>USB-C PD60W input and output, plus USB-A outputs, for compatible devices on the road.</p>
<div class="flag__tag">device power</div>
</div>
</div></article><article class="flag right"><div class="flag__surface">
<figure class="flag__media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-sales-feature-03.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A3 portable jump starter shown with vehicle dimensions" loading="lazy" width="1464" height="600" decoding="async"></figure><div class="flag__copy">
<div class="flag__index">04 / PORTABLE DESIGN</div>
<h3>Carry-ready, without the bulk.</h3>
<p>21 × 9 × 3.5 cm and 0.77 kg. The ABS + aluminum-alloy body stays easy to stow in an emergency kit.</p>
<div class="flag__tag">compact carry</div>
</div>
</div></article><article class="flag left" id="feature-smart-clamp"><div class="flag__surface">
<figure class="flag__media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-safety-v1.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A3 intelligent clamp controller, status light and red and black jumper clamps" loading="lazy" width="1958" height="803" decoding="async"></figure><div class="flag__copy">
<div class="flag__index">05 / SMART-CLAMP CONTROL</div>
<h3>Connect with more confidence.</h3>
<p>Smart-clamp status indicators plus reverse-polarity, short-circuit and connection protection help you check the setup before starting.</p>
<div class="flag__tag">smart-clamp control</div>
</div>
</div></article></section></section>
