<h2 class="a3-heading">Help, from first use onward.</h2>
<p class="a3-intro">Find the next step for setup, delivery or a problem with your order.</p>
<div class="support-layout">
<div>
<h3>Starting help</h3>
<div class="help-list">
<details class="help-detail"><summary>Before your first start</summary><div class="help-detail__body">
<p>Charge A3 to at least 50%. Confirm a compatible 12V vehicle battery, identify the positive and negative terminals, and follow the clamp connection sequence in the manual.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="{{ 'suntneew-a3-operating-guide-v20.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the A3 manual ↗</a>
</div></details><details class="help-detail" id="starting-help"><summary>The vehicle still won’t start</summary><div class="help-detail__body">
<p>Wait at least one minute between attempts. Stop after three unsuccessful attempts and follow the manual for disconnection. Repeated cranking can damage the unit; the vehicle battery or another fault may need attention.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@suntneew.com?subject=A3%20starting%20support">Get help with setup ↗</a>
</div></details><details class="help-detail"><summary>A connection or clamp warning</summary><div class="help-detail__body">
<p>Stop and check the clamp indication against the manual before another attempt. Do not bypass the clamp protections. Send us the vehicle details, A3 battery percentage and a photo of the clamp indication so we can help review the setup.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@suntneew.com?subject=A3%20clamp%20support">Contact product support ↗</a>
</div></details>
</div>
<div class="support-contact">
<strong>Need a hand with your A3?</strong><p>For fit, setup or an issue after delivery, email your order number (if available), vehicle details and a short description.</p>
<a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@suntneew.com?subject=A3%20product%20support">info@suntneew.com ↗</a>
</div>
</div>
