    <section class="a3-section" id="faq"><div class="a3-shell faq-layout">
<div>
<p class="product-kicker">FAQ</p>
<h2 class="a3-heading">A few things<br>before you go.</h2>
<p class="a3-intro">Vehicle fit, everyday use and what to do if you need help.</p>
<a class="text-link support-document-link" href="mailto:info@suntneew.com?subject=A3%20question">Ask a product question ↗</a>
</div>
<div class="faq-stack">
<details class="faq-detail" open><summary>Will A3 work with my vehicle?</summary><p>A3 is for compatible 12V vehicle systems, with an engine reference of up to 8.0L Gas / 5.5L Diesel. Battery condition, temperature and engine condition affect starting. Use the <a class="text-link" href="/pages/power-calculator?scenario=jump&amp;product=a3-16000" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vehicle Fit Check</a> and follow the product and vehicle instructions.</p></details><details class="faq-detail"><summary>What do 2500A Peak and 800A Starting mean?</summary><p>2500A Peak is the brief maximum output. 800A Starting is the rated starting current. Peak current is not continuous output; the vehicle and battery condition still affect the result.</p></details><details class="faq-detail"><summary>How many starts can I expect from one charge?</summary><p>50+ starts is the stated capability per full charge. Your actual number of starts depends on the engine, vehicle battery, temperature, remaining charge and connection setup.</p></details><details class="faq-detail"><summary>What if the vehicle still won’t start?</summary><p>Wait at least one minute between attempts and stop after three unsuccessful attempts. Follow the manual for disconnection and check the vehicle battery. See <a class="text-link" href="#starting-help">starting help</a> or contact us with your vehicle details and clamp status.</p></details><details class="faq-detail"><summary>Can A3 charge my USB-C devices?</summary><p>The USB-C port supports PD60W input and output. Check your device’s power requirements and use a compatible USB-C PD cable. USB-A outputs are also included.</p></details><details class="faq-detail"><summary>What happens if my order arrives damaged or incorrect?</summary><p>Email info@suntneew.com with your order number and clear photos so we can review the issue and provide instructions. Under our return policy, we cover return shipping for items that arrive damaged, defective or incorrect. <a class="text-link" href="/pages/return-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the return policy</a>.</p></details><details class="faq-detail"><summary>What comes in the case?</summary><p>The kit includes the A3 unit, intelligent jumper clamps, a PD60W USB-C cable, an EVA carry case and a user manual. See <a class="text-link" href="#in-the-box">In the box</a> for the full list.</p></details><details class="faq-detail"><summary>Why do the documents say CY-A3?</summary><p>A3 is the product name. CY-A3 is its model designation in the product and test documents.</p></details>
</div>
</div></section>
